# lipu pi jan Apen 🌠🏰🚀

mi jan Apen! mi olin e ilo ThinkPad. mi jan pi toki pona. mi musi kepeken ilo pana.

=> /tok/blog/   o lukin e lipu toki mi a!

## ilo pana lon ilo sona ni

=> /services.gmi   sona pi nasin toki ante (Gopher, DICT, QOTD, FTP...)
=> https://dreamstation.systems/professional/status   lipu pi pilin ilo (nasin HTTP taso)

* ilo pana tenpo NTP/NTS-KE lon kulupu NTP Pool
* poki Gemini ni (ilo OpenGET li lon insa)
* nasin Gopher
* nasin Gemini
* nasin Spartan
* nasin Finger (o kepeken: finger @dreamstation.systems)
* nasin DICT
* poki lipu FTP
* nasin QOTD
* nasin Daytime
* nasin Echo
* nasin Discard
* nasin Chargen

=> /tok/ntpuserinfo.gmi            nasin kepeken pi ilo pana NTP lon dreamstation.systems
=> /ntpstats.gmi                   nanpa pi ilo pana NTP (ilo li sin e ona lon tenpo ale)
=> /ge/                            ilo OpenGET
=> gopher://dreamstation.systems   ma sama, kepeken nasin Gopher
=> spartan://dreamstation.systems  ma sama, kepeken nasin Spartan
=> ftp://dreamstation.systems      poki lipu FTP

## pali mi

=> ftp://dreamstation.systems/robinsSoftware/ath             !~ATH | toki ilo nasa mi tan lipu Homestuck
=> ftp://dreamstation.systems/robinsSoftware/viewpoint       viewpoint | ilo pi toki tawa ilo sona, kepeken nasin WIMP
=> ftp://dreamstation.systems/robinsSoftware/fontliberator   fontliberator | ilo li pali sin e nasin sitelen, li lanpan ala. jan li pali ala
=> ftp://dreamstation.systems/robinsSoftware/xcaca           xcaca | ilo pana X lon sitelen ASCII
=> https://dreamstation.systems/hsptohtml/README/pages/README.html   ilo ni la lipu pi musi Hypnospace Outlaw li kama lipu W3 lon
=> https://github.com/OboeLang/oboe                          toki ilo Oboe. ona li tawa pali ale. mi en jan Jade K. li pali e ona
=> https://sushii64.com/                                     jan Jade K.

